fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Activate Fire Remnant
| desc = Upon losing this ability, {{H|Rubick}} stops after reaching a Rubick remnant while traveling.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
** Has the following {{M|projectile speed|text=travel speeds}}, whichever is faster:
**# {{hi|Ember Spirit}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}} at {{#var:Activate Fire Remnant value1}}-speed.
**# {{hi|Ember Spirit}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}} in {{#var:Activate Fire Remnant value2}} seconds.
** Hence, Xin travels even faster when the distance between two Fire Remnants is {{Code|≥ {{#expr:{{#var:Activate Fire Remnant value1}}*{{#var:Activate Fire Remnant value2}}}}-distance}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon cast.
*** Has the following properties while traveling:
**** {{M|Invulnerability}}
**** {{Symbol|Turn Rate|Lock}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
***** Locks Xin's {{M|facing angle}} toward [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px|East]] corresponding to the game's direction.
***** Can only cast {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} targeted abilities in the direction Xin is facing, except the following abilities:
****** {{A|Ember Spirit|Sleight of Fist}}, other ability interrruption notes apply.
****** {{A|Ember Spirit|Fire Remnant}}, hence, it has an {{M|instant cast}} time while traveling.
**** {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}}
***** [[File:Dota2 Ember Spirit Activate Fire Remnant Trajectory icon.png|84px]]
****** Always travels to the Fire Remnant furthest away from the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location, and travels to all active Fire Remnants on the map upon cast. Hence, the following is Xin's travel path when {{Symbol|Target|point}} point-targeted cast at [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px]] :
****** {{hi|Ember Spirit}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px]]
***** The remnant's proc time is determined upon the ability"s cast.
***** When interrupted, the remaining remnants detonate accordingly to the original travel time.
***** {{Symbol|mp cost}}
****** Does not increase the [[mana]] cost does upon reaching any Fire Remnants.
**** Does not continue traveling upon Xin's {{M|death}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Enemy units are affected by the radius damage once per Fire Remnant in the following conditions:
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}}
**** As Xin travels toward the first, and between Fire Remnants.
***** {{Symbol|Trees}}
****** [[Trees]] within 200-radius centered around the remnant are destroyed upon contact.
****** Some trees might not be destroyed and skipped while traveling at high speeds.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
**** Upon landing at the final Fire Remnant.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Activate Fire Remnant icon0}}
| desc = Select the Fire Remnant to arrive at.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows when interrupted by {{M|forced movement}} sources:
**# Negates the {{M|invulnerability}}.
**# The remnants detonate accordingly to the original travel time.
**# Xin then {{M|teleports}} to the last remnant's position.

