fields.value:
{{Breaknotes
| name = Fire Remnant
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus shd}} Explicitly disables the {{M|charge}} restore per kill component.<br><br>Other {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} components are still functional.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Fire Remnant
| desc = Creates a {{H|Rubick}} remnant. Leftover remnants from the previous cast cannot be used again despite reacquiring the ability.
}}


* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|ember_spirit_fire_remnant_remnant_tracker}}
*** Applies a buff on self per Remnant cast, indicating the remnant's current duration.
*** The buff disappears upon the Remnant expiring or is used.
** {{Symbol|Charges}}
*** Grants all [[charges]] immediately upon learning the ability.
*** {{cf|aghnotes}} Immediately grants {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Fire Remnant charges agh}}-{{#var:Fire Remnant charges}}}}|agh}} charges.
**** This happens once per game upon acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}}.
*** {{cf|shdnotes}} Adds two passive components to the ability.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Death}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** Restores {{ValueColor||{{#var:Fire Remnant type3 value2 shd}}|shd}} charge per enemy hero's [[death]] within the radius.
***** Considers enemy {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes; {{M|ally heroes|x}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
***** Considers the following conditions as valid enemy hero deaths:
****** {{M|Deny|text=Denies}}
****** Kill credited to the Fire Remnant's owner, including {{M|reincarnation}} sources.
****** To restore charges outside the death radius, Xin has to be credited for the kill.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Death}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***** Passively cast Fire Remnant of the corresponding level at Xin's death location.
***** Works independently of Fire Remnant's {{M|cooldown}}, last for its full duration, and neither cost {{M|mana}} nor consume {{M|charges}}.
***** Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.
***** Procs on {{M|reincarnation}} sources.

* {{Symbol|Fire Remnant}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Arrival}}
*** The remnant travel speed is set upon cast, does not adapt to Xin's current {{M|movement speed}}, and is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|RemnantSpeed {{=}} Hero[[Movement Speed|MS]] × {{#var:Fire Remnant value1}} OR {{ValueColor||{{#var:Fire Remnant value1 agh}}|agh}}}}
** The remnant additionally has the following properties:
*** {{M|Invulnerable}}
*** {{M|Unselectable}}
*** Does not deal damage upon expiring.
*** {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
**** The remnant's duration starts upon cast, this includes its travel time.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|No}}
**** Does not grant vision.
**** Cannot be seen within the {{M|Fog of War}}.
*** {{cf|shdnotes}}
**** Applies {{A|Ember Spirit|Immolation}} of its corresponding level, with its {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} sourced to Xin, upon reaching the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location.
**** Acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} does not update the current active Remnants.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Fire Remnant icon0}}
| desc = Sends a Fire Remnant that runs to the target location at 250% Ember Spirit's speed. Using Activate Fire Remnant, Ember Spirit will dash out to all active Fire Remnants, destroying them and dealing damage in an area and then moving to the nearest Remnant.  Ember Spirit will end at the Remnant closest to the targeted location.
}}
* With the {{M|movement speed}} limits, the remnant has the following min and max travel speeds:
** {{Code|MIN {{=}} {{#expr:{{G|movement speed min}}*{{#var:Fire Remnant value1}}}} OR {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{G|movement speed min}}*{{#var:Fire Remnant value1 agh}}}}|agh|x}}}}
** {{Code|MAX {{=}} {{#expr:{{G|movement speed max}}*{{#var:Fire Remnant value1}}}} OR {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{G|movement speed max}}*{{#var:Fire Remnant value1 agh}}}}|agh|x}}}}
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Losing the item does not reduce the current number of available charges.

* {{cf|shdnotes}} Deals up to {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Fire Remnant value2}}|v1={{Show|A|Ember Spirit|Immolation|value2 shd}}}}|shd}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} within the radius, for the entire duration.

